Rebon's Anchored Minimal bootstrap profile reproduces the model-facing surface
of the DeepSeek Harness **Minimal** agent preset. The following material is
copied or adapted from:

  https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
  commit 47f943859bef60e4160492346772ded9b24f765a

  - the Minimal preset persona text
    (`apps/cli/config/agent-presets/minimal/agent.cordis.yml`)
  - the Minimal preset's `bash` description override (same file) and the
    `bash` parameter schema
    (`packages/shell/tool-bash-persistent/src/index.ts`)
  - the `str_replace_editor` description and parameter schema
    (`packages/fs/tool-str-replace-editor/src/index.ts`)

It appears in this repository at:

  - crates/rebon-core/src/anchored_minimal.rs
  - crates/rebon-tool/src/str_replace_editor.rs

